[Cm]Ik pal mein tumko [A#]main bhula du [G#]nga,        Dil [Cm]todne ki [A#]yeh saza doo [Fm]nga
[Cm]Ik pal mein tum [A#]ko main bhula du [G#]nga,        D [Cm]il todne [A#]ki yeh saza do [Fm]onga

Meri [G#]yaadon ke mau [A#]sam jo tum ch [Fm]haye
Chahe [G#]jitna tum cha [A#]hoge par na aa [Cm]yenge,        [G#]Tumse door [A#]hum itna ho jayenge

[Cm]Lamha lamha tere bin [Fm]jiya na jaaye re
[D#]Dekhun har jagah main bas [Fm7]tere hi saaye re
[G#]Lamha lamha tere bin [Fm]jiya na jaaye re
[D#]Dekhun har jagah main bas [Fm7]tere hi saaye [Gm]re

Main toota hua [G#]saaz hoon [A#],        Tu meri [Fm7]awaaz tha
[D#]Likhi thi jahan [G#]zindagi,        [A#]Tu meri [Fm7]kitaab tha [D#]
[G#]Ab na fikar [A#]karna hum jee [Cm]jayenge,        [G#]Iss dard ko dh [A#]eere dheere [Cm]pee jayenge

Chahe [G#]jitna tum cha [A#]hoge par na aa [Cm]yenge,        [G#]Tumse door [A#]hum itna [Cm]ho jayenge
